  "transcript": {
    "segments": [
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "Ready for your day three recap? Here we go."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "♪ \"Better Days (Instrumental)\" by DARKMINDS ♪ We discovered how to bring real-world objects into augmented reality."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "Ari showed us how to design incredible actions and shortcuts for our apps."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- You open your app up to a world of Shortcuts possibilities."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- While Yusef helped us add some style to our user interfaces."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- This makes the label wrap around to as many lines as needed."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- Check out the new buttons system."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "Pop-ups, accessible design, and so much more! And hey, speaking of, did you catch Apple engineers and designers as they shared how we built Apple Watch with accessibility in mind? - I mean, we're talking about real sci-fi kind of things right now."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- Amazing! Meanwhile, we explored how to turn people into superheroes with Vision."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- This is cool."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- Can't wait to try that."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "We discovered how to move beyond passwords with iCloud Keychain and Passkeys."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- This is the first step of a multiyear effort in replacing passwords."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "- Phew. I'm gonna feel so secure."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "And we learned how you can create interactive, memorable experiences to onboard people into your app."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "And there's so much more amazing stuff on the way."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "",
        "text": "♪  Wow, that was a trip! ♪"
      }
    ]
  },
